This crate (`symphonia-codec-mace`) is a pure-Rust Apple MACE 3:1 and 6:1 decoder. It is licensed
under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

MACE has no public specification. The step-size and quantizer tables (`src/tables.rs`), the
adaptation and clipping logic (including the "broken" clip to -32767 that keeps the output
identical to the original binary decoder), and the block layout follow FFmpeg's
`libavcodec/mace.c`, which is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
or later.

